# Every text file in this repository is compared byte-for-byte by a gate: the shipped copies in `bundle/`
# against the kit's originals, and the committed example against what the templates currently render. A
# line-ending conversion on checkout fails those checks for reasons that have nothing to do with the change,
# which trains a reader to ignore them.
#
# So: normalise to LF in the repository and in the working tree, on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, for the benefit of the diff viewer. Nothing here is committed yet, but a `.gitattributes` that only
# covers the files present today is one somebody has to remember to update.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.tgz binary
*.zstd binary
